(6, 'Inductively Couple Plasma Optical Emission Spectrometer (ICP-OES)', 7, 6, 6, 6, 6, 1, 'Thermo Scientific', 'iCAP7000 DUO MCF', '2012', '', '<p>A trace-level, elemental analysis technique that uses the emission spectra of a sample to identify, and quantify the elements present. Simultaneous, sequential analysis of multiple elements and high number of measurable elements is possible .</p>\r\n', 'https://www.thermofisher.com/order/catalog/product/842320074181', '', 'Yes', 13.00, 0.00, 'Analytical Instruments Pvt Ltd', '0112639000', 'http://www.aipl.lk/', 30, 60, 6, '', 'Yes', 1, 'University Funds', '2018-09-02', 1, 'Prof. MGTS Amarasekara', 'thusitha@agri.rjt.ac.lk', '0252221612', '0714479148', '                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        Metal Analysis, Trace & heavy metals, Industrial and Environmental Samples                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           