(313, 'Agricultural Survey Drone', 7, 6, 13, 37, 120, 1, 'Parrot ', 'Bluegrass', '2021', '', '                                                                                         Parrot Bluegrass is a multipurpose quadcopter designed for agriculture that helps farmers improve their ROI,\r\nusing its 2 embedded cameras; video camera and multispectral sensor.\r\nWith its front Full HD video camera, this solution helps farmers visually monitor the farm’s infrastructure, the land and herds.\r\nIt also enables farmers to quickly get an overview and detect problem areas in all types of crop fields, Parrot Bluegrass can automatically cover up to 30 hectares at 70 m / 230 ft. flight altitude per battery. It can also\r\nfly at low altitudes, optimizing it to scout fruit crops that require accurate mapping precision.                                                                                                                        ', 'https://www.parrot.com/assets/s3fs-public/2021-09/bd_bluegrass_productsheet_en_210x297_2018-03-01.pdf', '', '', 1483920.00, 0.00, 'Bhoomi Tech (Pvt)Ltd', '+94 11 271 3088', 'https://www.bhoomitech.com/', 2, 5, 1, NULL, 'Yes', 1, 'AHEAD Grant Fund', '2021-01-08', 1, 'Dr. N. Geekiyanage', 'nalaka.geekiyanage@agri.rjt.ac.lk', '0252221611', '', 'Multispectral sensor, NDVI, Land survey, Land use mapping, Vegetation analysis                                                                                ', NULL, 'Drone_1.jpg', 'Drone_2.jpg', 'Drone_3.jpg', 'Drone_4.jpg', 0, 46, '2022-09-05 11:55:05', 36, '2022-09-13 23:05:11', NULL, NULL, NULL),
