(333, 'Elementar - Vario EL Cube C H N Analyser', 20, 0, 0, 27, 130, 1, 'Elementar ', 'Vario El Cube', '2019', '', '                                                                                                                                     This elemental analyzer stands for highest performance and versatility in elemental analysis. The vario EL cube is designed for simultaneous carbon, hydrogen, nitrogen. The vario EL cube will perfectly adjust to all your analytical needs in elemental analysis with highest precision and accuracy. Thanks to its low-maintenance design, the vario EL cube is optimized for unattended 24/7 operation and highest system uptime.                                                                                                                        ', '', '', '', 0.00, 3600.00, 'Elementar', 'E mail - info@elementar.com', 'https://www.elementar.com/', 80, 80, 10, NULL, 'Yes', 1, 'Ministry of Water Supply', '2021-10-01', 1, 'Dr. Thejani Premachandra', 'chinasrilankargp17@gmail.com', '0812058116', '', '                                                                                                                           Carbon, Hydrogen,Nitrogen,Soil, Sludge, Charcoal, Poultry Feed,                                                                                                                        ', NULL, 'CHN_JRDC_1.jpg', 'CHN_JRDC_2.jpg', '', '', 0, 139, '2022-09-08 16:38:01', 139, '2022-09-08 16:42:27', NULL, NULL, NULL),
