(493, 'GCMS-MS', 2, 0, 2, 203, 163, 1, 'Agilent', 'Agilent 7000D', '2018', '', '<p>The 7000D Triple Quadrupole GC/MS is the latest version of the most successful GC/MS/MS in history. The 7000D is now even easier to use and more efficient than ever, due to its new Dynamic MRM (dMRM) mode of acquisition. Coupled with the 9000 GC, the 7000D MS works in perfect harmony to enhance productivity, save resources and alert operators about pending maintenance</p>\r\n', '', '', '', 0.00, 0.00, 'Techno Instruments Pvt Ltd', '+94 11 2765 557', 'https://www.technoinstruments.com/index.php', 0, 0, 0, '', 'Yes', 1, 'Government Grant', '', 0, 'Mr M N A Mubarak', 'dir_ral@iti.lk', '+94 11 237', '+94 71 635', '                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ', NULL, 'iti_gc_ms_ms.jpg', '', '', '', 0, 211, '2022-09-12 23:13:15', 79, '2024-01-29 13:19:55', NULL, NULL, NULL),
