(661, 'TOC Analyzer ​', 20, 0, 0, 27, 129, 1, 'Tailin', 'HTY-DI1500', '0000', '', '<p>The HTY-DI1500 laboratory TOC Analyzer is designed to determinate the TOC levels of purified water, WFI and Ultra-purified water. It uses UV lamp oxidation technology for accurate, dependable operation with minimal maintenance. The analysis is made by the software installed on computer, it is easy to operate and in compliance with the GMP and 21CFR PART 11 requirements.</p>', 'https://www.tailinscitech.com/analytical-instruments/toc-analyzer-di1500.html', '', '', 0.00, 4100.00, 'Tailin', '+86-134 2914 4802', 'https://www.tailinscitech.com/', 1, 25, 10, '', 'Yes', 1, 'Ministry of Water Supply', '2021-10-01', 1, 'Dr. Thejani Premachandra', 'chinasrilankargp17@gmail.com', '0812058116', '', '                                         Pharmaceutical Water, Ultrapure Water, Semiconductor Water, Total Organic Carbon, (Purified Samples EC<5μS/cm).                                        ', NULL, 'JRDC_TOC.jpg', '', '', '', 0, 139, '2022-09-15 13:37:51', 1, '2026-06-21 17:37:54', NULL, NULL, NULL),
