(759, 'Kjeltec System 1002 Distilling unit', 24, 74, 208, 270, 58, 1, 'FOSS', 'Kjeltec™ 1002 System', '1982', '', '   The 1002 Kjeltec System can be used to determine nitrogen / protein according to the Kjeldahl\r\nmethod. One of the main applications for the unit is the distillation of “Kjeldahl digests” where the alkali is\r\nconveniently added via a built in dispensing system. The distillate is collected in a Receiver flask for subsequent titration.                                                                            ', '', '1002-kjeltec-manual.pdf', '', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '', 0, 0, 0, NULL, '', 0, 'GOSL', '0000-00-00', 0, 'M.M.K. Premakumara', 'mmk@ansci.ruh.ac.lk', '0412292387', '', '               Nitrogen, Protein, Kjeldahl\r\n                                                               ', NULL, 'Picture1.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 284, '2022-09-23 09:12:40', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
