(1021, 'Trinocular Microscope with image projection', 16, 0, 253, 362, 106, 1, 'Optica microscopes, Italy', 'B-500TPL', '0000', '', '<p>It consists of a new combination of LED and optical technology. A new high-efficiency single chip LED works in combination with a special optical lens, which allows to double the intensity of the light generated by the LED itself. The result is a quantity of light equivalent to the light generated by a normal 30-35W halogen bulb, but with a colour temperature of 6300K,It means white light instead of the yellow one produced by halogen bulbs,The electrical consumption (3.6W only) shows the high efficiency of the system.</p>\r\n', '', NULL, '', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '', 0, 0, 0, '', 'Yes', 1, 'Treasury funds', '', 1, 'Dr. Deepthi Amarasena', 'deepthiamarasena@yahoo.com ', '0522258201', '0718326361', '                                                                                    ', NULL, 'Optica_trinocular.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 22, '2022-12-21 10:10:56', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
