(1049, 'Laboratory Oven', 16, 0, 253, 362, 173, 1, 'MEMMERT, Germany', 'UF 260', '0000', '', '<p>The universally applicable lab oven U is Memmert&rsquo;s classic appliance for temperature control in science, research and material tests in industry. The technologically perfected masterpiece made of high-quality, hygienic, easy-to-clean stainless steel leaves nothing to be desired in terms of ventilation and control technology, overtemperature protection and precisely tuned heating technology.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '', 0, 0, 0, '', 'Yes', 1, 'Treasury funds', '', 1, 'Dr.Deepthi Amaraena', 'deepthiamarasena@yahoo.com', '0522258201', '0718189661', '                                                                                                                                                                     ', NULL, 'MEMMERT_oven.png', '', '', '', 0, 22, '2022-12-21 15:48:15', 22, '2022-12-22 14:10:21', NULL, NULL, NULL),
