(1341, 'Automatic Atmospheric Distillation unit', 47, 81, 256, 390, 317, 3, 'Anton Paar', 'ADU 5', '0000', '', '<p>The ADU 5 is designed for the distillation of petroleum products and volatile organic sample liquids in standardized boiling point groups for the examination of;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Motor gasolines</li>\r\n	<li>Aviation gasolines</li>\r\n	<li>Aviation turbines fuels</li>\r\n	<li>special boiling point spirits</li>\r\n	<li>Naphthas</li>\r\n	<li>White spirits</li>\r\n	<li>Kerosines</li>\r\n	<li>Gas oils</li>\r\n	<li>Distillate fuels oils</li>\r\n	<li>Solvents and similar petroleum products</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The aim of the distillation is a determination of the distillation curve at atmospheric pressure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The device conducts program-controlled distillation tests with programmable boiling point groups and automatically controlled heating rate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A light barrier system records the curve of the volume increase of the distillate during the time interval.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After ending the distillation,the boiling point curve is displayed and recorded</p>\r\n', '', '', '', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '', 1, 0, 0, '', '', 1, 'University of Moratuwa', '', 1, 'Mrs.Hasini Gunarathna', '', 'Ext:4100', '', '                                                                                                                                                                     ', NULL, 'automatic.JPG', '', '', '', 0, 488, '2024-08-26 14:43:43', 488, '2024-08-28 12:56:50', NULL, NULL, NULL),
