(1499, 'PCR Machine', 39, 0, 307, 574, 400, 4, 'China', 'TC-95/G/H(b)C ', '2015', 'sarojinifernando787@gmail.com', '<p>A PCR (Polymerase Chain Reaction) machine is used to amplify and detect specific DNA sequences in genomic DNA samples. This helps identify plant pathogens, such as fungi, bacteria, and viruses, that may be causing diseases in plants. In the context of plant pathology, this technique allows for accurate diagnosis of causal agents of diseases and effective disease management strategies.</p>\r\n', '', NULL, '', 0.00, 0.00, 'Avon Pharmo Chem (Pvt) Ltd', '', '', 96, 96, 5, '<p>Name: LifeECO</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Model : TC-96/G/H (b) C</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SN: BYQ6078E-908</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Make : China</p>\r\n', 'Yes', 1, 'NSF Equipment grant', '2021-12-12', 1, 'T.H.P. Sarojini Fernando', 'sarojinifernando787@gmail.com', '0342247426', '0743018201', '                                                                                    ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 657, '2025-02-21 12:30:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
