(17, 'Fat Content', 'Determine crude fat or other components soluble in organic solvents', '                         fat extraction system is specially optimized to determine crude fat or other components soluble in organic solvents according to the universally known Solvent extraction method, including both Randall and Twisselmann methods.                                                            ', 'Coconut related products, other Food & Feed  ,Pharmaceuticals, Sewage water, Mineral oils, Lubricants and  Soils.', '              Fat Extractor                                                                      ', 0, 30, NULL, '2022-07-20 11:30:41', NULL, 18, 0, 0, NULL),
(18, 'Real Time PCR Machine', 'Up to 6 separate channels (365–680 nm excitation, 460–750 nm detection), Fixed optical path, separate high-power excitation LEDs and emission filters per channel, Highly sensitive photomultiplier (PMT) detector with gain setting (sensitivity control), Dynamic range: 10 orders of magnitude (assay dependent), PCR Tubes 0.2 ml: 0.2 ml x 36 wells, 15–50 µl recommended reaction volume, individual tubes with caps', '          Quantitative, real-time PCR is a precision science that places high demands on the instrument, chemistry, and software. Highthermal and optical uniformity, short equilibration times, and fast ramping rates are critical for precise and rapid quantitativeanalysis. Sensitivity, speed, and specificity are also highly dependent on the performance of the DNA polymerase andreaction components.                                                                            ', 'Rotor Gene Q 5 plex', '                                                                                    ', 0, 34, NULL, '2022-07-22 21:37:49', NULL, 7, 0, 0, NULL),
(19, 'Gas Analysers', 'CO2, H20, Photosynthesis, Respiration, Transpiration, Stomatal Conductance, Leaf Temperature, Soil Respiration, Insect Respiration', 'These equipment are used for leaf gas exchange & chlorophyll fluorescence measurement.', 'Infrared Gas Analysis Systems', 'LiCOR BioScience Portable Photosynthesis Systems, CID BioScience Handheld Photosynthesis Systems, PP Systems CI-340 Handheld Photosynthesis System                                                                                ', 0, 36, NULL, '2022-07-21 06:48:21', NULL, 7, 0, 0, NULL),
(20, 'Digital Droplet PCR', 'Absolute quantification, Mutation detection, Genome editing, Copy number variation, Gene expression', 'The QIAcuity Digital PCR System makes absolute quantification accessible and affordable for all laboratories. The walk-away automation integrates and streamlines the entire digital PCR workflow of partitioning, thermocycling and imaging into a single instrument with minimal hands-on time. It is also easy to adapt your current qPCR assays to the QIAcuity Digital PCR System. No change in plate handling is required when coming from qPCR, assuring fast assay setup and quick results in under 2 hours.', 'QIAcuity® Digital PCR System', '                                                                                    ', 0, 24, NULL, '2022-07-21 11:28:18', NULL, 7, 0, 0, NULL),
(21, 'Drying & dehydration', 'Dry matters ', 'Freeze Drying is a process of  removing moisture/water or other solvents in a sample, under  the frozen and vacuum conditions. ', 'Food , Fodder, liquids and  extracts (plant & non-plant)', 'Freeze dryer                                                                     ', 0, 34, NULL, '2022-09-01 09:49:31', NULL, 7, 0, 0, NULL),
(22, 'Food Quality', 'Free Fatty Acids in 1 minutes, Peroxide Value in 4 minutes,  Iodine Value in Palm Oil in 2 minutes, ', '                          The speed and ease of use of CDR FoodLab® is analytical methods become competitive advantages for food industries producing oils or fats, or that employ them as ingredients.CDR FoodLab® can determine:Free Fatty Acids in 1 minutePeroxide Value in 4 minutesp-Anisidine Value in 2 minutesSoaps in 2 minutesIodine Value in Palm Oil in 2 minutesPolyphenols on Olive Oil in 5 minutesCDR FoodLab® is the chemical analysis system designed and developed to provide accurate results at every step of the production process: the system is so easy to use that it can be utilized not only in a laboratory, but real time at the production plant for process control or quality control, even by staff with no previous specific lab tech experience.                                                          ', 'Solid and Liquid Food Samples with fat', '                            Food Lab                                                        ', 0, 30, NULL, '2022-07-25 16:05:24', NULL, 18, 0, 0, NULL),
(23, 'Pathogen Detection', 'Determination of Cycle Threshold (CT) value of samples', 'Real Time PCR System provide more reliable results of pathogen detection. It is a modern and versatile technique providing different ways of analysis including Standard curve, Relative standard curve, Comparative CT, Genotyping and Presence/absence. System has run time of less than 2 hours and five-color detection enable user to use a broad range of fluorophores including FAM™/SYBR®  . Green I, VIC®/JOE, NED™/ TAMRA™/ Cy3™, ROX™/Texas Red®, and Cy5™ dyes for greater assay versatility. Supports 96-well format plates and 0.2 mL tubes', 'Phytoplasma, Bacteria and Fungi', 'Applied Biosystems 7500 Real-Time PCR System                                                                                  ', 0, 45, NULL, '2022-08-06 23:00:09', NULL, 18, 0, 0, NULL),
(24, 'Liquid', 'COD(Mn), Ammonia Nitrogen, Total Phosphorous, Fluoride, Chromium, Manganese, Iron, Heavy Metals (Zn,Cd,Pb,Cu), Hardness, Anionic Surfactants, Cyanide, Arsenic, pH, Conductivity, Turbidity,  Nitrate nitrogen,  Nitrite Nitrogen, Volatile Phenol,  Formaldehyde, Chloride,  Biological Toxicity, DO, Colour, Alkalinity, Temperature,  ORP, Level of Nitrogen, Hydrodynamic Diameter, Zeta Potential, Aromatic Organic compounds, Cations, Anions, Volatile Organic Compounds, Non Volatile Organic Compounds, Total Coliform, E-coli.', '                                                                                    ', 'Surface Water, Ground Water, Treated water', 'Automatic Multi-Channel Water Quality Analyzer, Multiparameter Water Quality Analyzer, Portable Water Quality Comprehensive Toxicity Analyzer, Automatic Titrator, Portable meters, Particle Size Analyzer, UV-Visible Spectrophotometer, Ion Chromatograph, Atomic Fluorescence Spectrophotopmer, Inductively Coupled Plasma-Mass Spectrometer, Ultra-High-Performance Liquid Chromatography-Tandem Quadrupole Mass Spectrometer, High-Performance Liquid Chromatography, Gas Chromatography- ECD/FID-Mass Spectrometer- Tandem Quadrupole Mass spectrometer.                                               ', 1, 52, NULL, '2022-07-29 14:20:19', NULL, 20, 0, 52, '2022-08-01 09:58:18'),
