(27, 'Micro Manipulator', 'Genetic transformation and Microbial inoculation in live cells , In-Vitro fertilization', 'Observation method - Brightfield, Apodized Phase Contrast*1, Phase Contrast, Nikon Advanced Modulation Contrast*2, DIC, Emboss Contrast*3, Epi-Fluorescence, Spindle Observation                                                                  ', 'Trinocular Inverted Microscope', 'Gene gun, Electrophoras                           ', 0, 24, NULL, '2022-08-17 11:58:33', NULL, 7, 0, 0, NULL),
(28, 'Crystallographic Analysis', 'Crystal Structures, Lattice Parameters, Strain, Grain size, Phase Composition, Crystal defects', 'X-ray diffraction (XRD) is a powerful non-destructive technique for characterizing crystalline materials. X-ray diffraction peaks are produced by constructive interference of a monochromatic beam of X-rays scattered at specific angles from each set of lattice planes in a sample. This technique is commonly used in many fields, including the Pharmaceutical industry, forensic science, geological science, ceramic and glass industry, etc. For example, in the ceramic industry, XRD is used to determine elemental composition analysis, the arrangements of those elements, defects, and quantity of elements and compounds.', 'Crystal Structure, Material\'s Crystalline phases, Chemical Composition', 'X-Ray Diffractometer (XRD)                                  ', 0, 54, NULL, '2022-07-29 23:07:38', NULL, 17, 0, 0, NULL),
(29, 'Chemical Properties', '', 'FTIR offers quantitative and qualitative analysis for organic and some inorganic samples, thus reveal the composition of solids, liquids, and gases. It can identify chemical bonds in a molecule by producing an infrared absorption spectrum. FTIR is an effective analytical instrument for detecting functional groups and characterizing covalent bonding information. FTIR is a common technique in analyzing samples in the fields of environmental monitoring, forensics, pharmaceuticals, quality control, etc. The FTIR spectroscopy is used to identify compounds such as compounded plastics, blends, fillers, paints, rubbers, coatings, resins, and adhesives.', 'Functional Groups, Chemical Bonds, IR absorption ', 'FTIR Spectrometer  ', 0, 54, NULL, '2022-07-30 00:27:04', NULL, 17, 0, 0, NULL),
(30, 'Water - Volatile Phenol', 'C6H6O', 'The product adopts the detection principle of 4-amino-antipyrine spectrophotometry, and the combination of online distillation and constant gas flow is preferred, which greatly shortens the distillation and separation time of volatile phenol. Amino-antipyrine reacts to generate orange-red indoxyl-antipyrine dye, and the automatic monitoring of volatile phenol concentration is completed by colorimetric photometric detection.                                                             ', 'Municipal sewage, Pollution source Discharge water, Surface water, Groundwater.', 'LFS-2002 (Phe) Volatile Phenol Water Quality Analyzer                                                                                   ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 11:59:32', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(31, 'Water - Chemical Oxygen Demand', 'COD', 'The product adopts the detection principle of the potassium permanganate oxidative titration method. The pretreated water sample is oxidized and digested by potassium permanganate under constant temperature conditions, and then reduced by adding excess sodium oxalate solution and titrated with potassium permanganate solution. For reducing agents, the titration endpoint is judged by absorbance or redox potential, and the volume of potassium permanganate volume calculates the permanganate index value dropped back. The instrument has two detection methods of acidity and alkalinity. When the chloride ion concentration in the solution is high, the alkaline potassium permanganate oxidative titration method can be used to eliminate the interference of chloride ions in the solution.                                                                     ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, and Drinking Water', 'LFS-2002 (CODMn) Permanganate Index Water Quality Analyzer', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 11:59:13', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(32, 'Water - Heavy Metals', 'Pb, Cd, Zn, Cu', 'The product is based on the electrochemical detection technology of anodic stripping voltammetry, which eliminates the influence of heavy metal inter-compounds on the detection during the electrodeposition process, and the detection period is less than or equal to 15min. Monitoring parameters include zinc, cadmium, lead and copper                                                       ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water, Industrial Wastewater, Domestic Sewage.', 'LFEC-2006 Heavy Metal Water Quality Analyzer                                                             ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 11:58:57', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(33, 'Water - Cyanide', 'CN-', 'This product adopts isonicotinic acid-barbituric acid spectrophotometry, according to the fact that cyanide and chloramine-T can generate cyanogen chloride under the action of active chlorine, and then react with an isonicotinic acid-barbituric acid reagent to generate violet blue The degree of the colour change of the solution is proportional to the concentration of cyanide in the water, and the concentration of cyanide can be obtained according to the color photometric detection of the color.                                                      ', 'Municipal Sewage, Pollution Source Discharge Water, Surface Water, Groundwater.', 'LFS-2002 (CN) Cyanide Water Quality Analyzer                                                                          ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 12:12:17', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(34, 'Water - Anionic Surfactant', 'Anionic Surfactant', 'This product adopts methylene blue spectrophotometry. The anionic surfactant in the sample reacts with methylene blue to form blue salts. The intensity of the color is proportional to the concentration of the anionic surfactant, which can be calculated according to the color-developing photometric detection absorbance value. Concentration value of anionic surfactant. The instrument is based on the national standard or industry standard and has the characteristics of simple operation, a high degree of automation, easy maintenance, and low cost of consumables.                                                                              ', 'Domestic Water, Drinking Water, Surface Water, Sewage and Wastewater', 'LFS-2002 (LAS) Anionic Surfactant Water Quality Analyzer                                                                               ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 12:19:29', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(35, 'Water- Ammonia Nitrogen', 'Ammonia Nitrogen', 'This product uses salicylic acid spectrophotometry to determine ammonia nitrogen. In the presence of sodium nitroferricyanide, ammonium reacts with salicylate and hypochlorite ions to form blue compounds. Through photometric colorimetry, ammonia nitrogen is achieved. Full automation of the concentration detection process. The instrument can eliminate the interference of sample turbidity, chromaticity, substrate interference, and other factors in the results of ammonia nitrogen determination. The detection limit of ammonia nitrogen can reach 0.02mg/L, realizing high precision, low detection limit, high stability, and low maintenance of ammonia nitrogen. Fully automatic online monitoring.                                           ', 'Surface water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking water sources, Domestic sewage', 'LFS-2002 (NH) ammonia nitrogen water quality analyzer                                     ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 14:59:53', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(36, 'Water- Total Phosphorus', 'Total Phosphorus', 'The product digests the sample with potassium persulfate and oxidizes all the phosphorus contained in it to orthophosphate. In an acidic medium, in the presence of antimony salt, orthophosphate reacts with ammonium molybdate to form a phosphomolybdic heteropolyacid, which is immediately reduced by ascorbic acid to form a blue compound. The total phosphorus content in the water samples was then measured by spectrophotometry.                                                       ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking water sources,  Domestic sewage.', 'LFS-2002 (TP) Total Phosphorus Water Quality Analyzer                                         ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 15:05:56', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(37, 'Water - Nitrate Nitrogen', 'Nitrate Nitrogen', 'This product uses UV spectrophotometry to determine nitrate nitrogen and uses the absorption of nitrate ions at 220mm wavelength to determine nitrate. Through the difference in absorbance at 220nm and 275nm, the interference of dissolved organic matter was removed, and the concentration of nitrate nitrogen in the water sample was obtained.                                  ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking water sources, domestic sewage.', 'LFS-2002 (NO₃) nitrate-nitrogen water quality analyzer                                                                          ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 15:15:58', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(38, 'Water - Nitrite Nitrogen', 'Nitrite Nitrogen', 'This product adopts N-(1-naphthalene) ethylenediamine dihydrochloride spectrophotometric method to detect nitrite nitrogen. A purple-red complex is formed in the environment of ℃, and the color of the solution is proportional to the content of nitrite nitrogen in the sample. The instrument determines the content of nitrite nitrogen in the water sample by photoelectric calorimetry.                                      ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources,  Domestic sewage.', ' LFS-2002 (NO₂) nitrite nitrogen water quality analyzer                                                      ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 15:21:05', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(39, 'Water- Chromium', 'Hexavalent Chromium', 'The product adopts UV-Vis spectrophotometry, and through modular design, parameters can be switched according to needs.                                                                                    ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic sewage.', 'LFS-2002 (Cr) Hexavalent Chromium water quality analyzer                                                               ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 15:30:40', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(40, 'Water - Arsenic', 'Arsenic', 'The product adopts UV-Vis spectrophotometry, and through modular design, parameters can be switched according to needs.                                                                ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'LFS-2002 (As) - I- Arsenic water quality analyzer                                                                      ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 15:35:52', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(41, 'Water- Manganese', 'Manganese', 'The product adopts UV-Vis spectrophotometry, and through modular design, parameters can be switched according to needs.                                                ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage. ', 'LFS-2002 (Mn) Manganese water quality analyzer                                           ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 15:41:40', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(42, 'Water- Iron', 'Iron', 'The product adopts UV-Vis spectrophotometry, and through modular design, parameters can be switched according to needs. ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources,  Domestic Sewage.', 'LFS-2002 series heavy metal water quality analyzer', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 15:54:15', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(43, 'Water- Total Hardness', 'Total Soluble (Ca, Mg) Hardness', 'This product is based on the principle of titration or spectrophotometry to determine the total soluble (calcium, magnesium) hardness in sample water.              ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'LFS-2002 (HD) Total Hardness Water Analyzer                                                        ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 16:07:22', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(44, 'Water - Methanal', 'Formaldehyde', 'Formaldehyde is usually a colorless aqueous solution or gas with a pungent odor, easily soluble in water, and irritating to human eyes and nose. In the presence of excessive ammonium salt, the reaction of formaldehyde and acetylacetone would generate a yellow compound, which has the maximum absorption at the wavelength of 414nm. The absorbance(A) is measured and the absorbance is stable within 3h of color development. And\r\nthe standard operating curve is searched based on value A, and the concentration of formaldehyde is then\r\ncalculated.                                                          ', 'Municipal Sewage, Pollution Source Discharge Water, Surface Water,  Groundwater.', 'LFS-2002(CHO) Methanal Water Quality Analyzer                                                                            ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-01 16:21:07', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(45, 'Water - Turbidity', 'Turbidity', 'The monitoring parameter of this product is Turbidity. It has the functions of automatic calibration, automatic temperature compensation, and automatic probe cleaning.', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'LFWCS-2008(TB) Turbidity Water Quality Analyzer', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-02 12:08:33', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(46, 'Water - pH', 'pH', 'The monitoring parameter of this product is pH. It has the functions of automatic calibration, automatic temperature compensation, and automatic probe cleaning.\r\n   ', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'LFWCS-2008(pH) pH Water Quality Analyzer', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-02 12:11:40', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(47, 'Water - Conductivity', 'Conductivity', 'The monitoring parameter of this product is Conductivity. It has the functions of automatic calibration, automatic temperature compensation, and automatic probe cleaning.\r\n', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'LFWCS-2008(C) Conductivity Water Quality Analyzer', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-02 12:15:02', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(48, 'Water - Dissolved Oxygen', 'Dissolved Oxygen', 'The monitoring parameter of this product is Dissolved Oxygen. It has the functions of automatic calibration, automatic temperature compensation, and automatic probe cleaning.\r\n', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'LFWCS-2008(DO) Dissolved Oxygen Water Quality Analyzer', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-02 12:18:34', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(49, 'Water - Chromaticity', 'Chromaticity', 'The monitoring parameter of this product is Chromaticity.  It has automatic calibration, automatic temperature adjustment, and automatic probe cleaning capabilities.', 'Surface Water, Groundwater, Seawater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'LFS-2002(SD) Colority Water Quality Analyzer', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-08-02 12:41:32', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(50, 'Colony Counter', 'CFU/mL (colony-forming units per milliliter) for liquids and CFU/g (colony-forming units per gram) for solids.', 'Colony counters are used to estimate a liquid culture’s density of microorganisms by counting individual colonies on an agar plate, slide, mini gel, or Petri dish. ', 'On an accurate count of bacterial colonies and cells', 'Rocker (Galaxy230), ColeParmer / UK (SC6 Plus)                                  ', 0, 46, NULL, '2022-08-03 09:59:34', NULL, 7, 0, 0, NULL),
(51, 'UV-Visible Spectroscopy', 'light absorbed, transmitted, reflected by the sample, Concentration, Absorbing Wavelength ', 'UV/VIS spectroscopy implies absorption/reflection measurements carried out in the ultraviolet and visible light spectrum. According to the Beer-Lambert law, which links the attenuation of light to the characteristics of the material through which the light passes, a sample’s absorbance is directly proportional to the concentration of the absorbing specimen. This technique is extensively used in research and analytical laboratories for the quantitative and qualitative analysis of all molecules and specific compounds that absorb ultraviolet and visible electromagnetic radiation. UV-Visible technique can be employed in impurity detection of compounds, concentration measurements, structure elucidation of organic compounds, studying chemical kinetics, and detection of functional groups etc.                                              ', 'Optical Absorption of Transparent liquids, solids, thin-films and glass', 'UV-Visible Spectrometer                           ', 0, 54, NULL, '2022-08-04 11:24:31', NULL, 17, 0, 0, NULL),
(52, 'CNC Machine', 'NA', 'CNC machining is subtractive manufacturing technology, and it is a process used in the manufacturing sector that involves the use of computers to control machine tools like lathes, mills and grinders. This technique allows to machine components with high repeatability and precision, perform unmanned machining operations, improve production planning, and increase productivity. Here the parts are created by removing material from a solid block (called the blank or the workpiece) using a variety of cutting tools                           ', 'Unmanned machining operations, Engineering Tool, Manufacturing Industry', 'CNC Machine', 0, 54, NULL, '2022-08-04 11:56:56', NULL, 17, 0, 0, NULL),
(53, 'Gel Electrophoresis', ' DNA sequencing or mass spectrometry', 'it is used in DNA fingerprinting and the detection of genetic variants and proteins involved in health and disease as well as in the detection and purification of nucleic acids and proteins for research.                                                                                     ', 'techniques used to separate molecules of DNA, RNA, or protein on the basis of their size or electric charge.', 'Gel Electrophoresis Unit- Cleaver Scientific (MSCHOICE10)\r\n                                                                                    ', 0, 46, NULL, '2022-08-04 11:59:09', NULL, 7, 0, 0, NULL),
(54, 'Mechanical Properties of Materials', '', '             UTM is used to test the mechanical properties of materials such as tensile and compressive strength. It can accommodate many kinds of materials, ranging from hard samples, such as metals and concrete, to flexible samples, such as rubber and textiles. This diversity makes the UTM equally applicable to virtually any manufacturing industry. Other tests that can perform using the UTM includes seal strength test, bond strength test, gliding force test, coefficient of friction test, spring testing and food texture analysis.                                                                        ', 'Universal Testing Machine, Tensile Strength, Compressive strength', '           Universal Testing Machine (UTM)                                                                         ', 0, 54, NULL, '2022-08-04 13:10:32', NULL, 17, 0, 0, NULL),
(55, 'Water', 'Odour, Taste, pH, Sulphate, Suspended Solids, Total Dissolved Solids, Turbidity, Magnesium, Nitrates, Total Phoshorous, Chloride, Electrical Conductivity, Hardness, Total Alkalinity, Free Ammnonia, Albuminoid ammonia, Calsium, COD, Free residual Chlorine, Iron, Trace metals', '                                                                                    ', 'Bottled Drinking Water, Natural Mineral Water, Waste Water', 'pH meter, Conductivity meter, UV-Spectrophotometer, Atomic Absorbtion Spectrophotometer, ICP-MS                                                                                    ', 0, 20, NULL, '2022-08-04 16:08:42', NULL, 11, 0, 0, NULL),
(56, 'Fertilizer', 'Total Nitrigen, Ammnical Nitrogen, Total Phosphorus,  Water Soluble Phosphorus, Citric acid Soluible Phosphorus, Total Pottasium, Water Soluble Potassium,  Calcium, Magnisium, Biuret, Moisture, Trace metals', '                                                                                    ', 'Fertilizer and Fertilizer mixtures', 'UV-Spectrophotometer,  Atomic Absorbtion Spectrophotometer, ICP-MS                                            ', 0, 20, NULL, '2022-08-04 16:00:26', NULL, 11, 0, 0, NULL),
(57, 'Porcelain Tableware', 'Test for release Lead and Cadmium', '                                                                                    ', 'Porcelain Tableware, Ceramicware, Glass Ceramicware, Glass dinnerware', 'Atomic Absorption Spectro[photometer                                                                                    ', 0, 20, NULL, '2022-08-04 16:08:20', NULL, 11, 0, 0, NULL),
(58, 'Nitrogen and Protein Analysis', 'Nitrogen, Protein', 'The Kjeldahl method is an analytical method for the quantitative determination of nitrogen in chemical substances. This is a standard method for estimating the protein content in foods, feed, beverages, and many other samples. The Kjeldahl method involves three main steps, i.e. digestion of organic nitrogen, the distillation of ammonia and titrations to determine nitrogen content in samples. The Kjeldahl method is also used to measure nitrogen in organic and inorganic samples in the chemical industry, the pharmaceutical industry and in environmental samples. For example, nitrogen determination in wastewaters and soil samples.                                                         ', 'Nitrogen and Protein contents in Chemical Substances', '                                                                                    Kjeldahl apparatus', 0, 54, NULL, '2022-08-04 18:49:42', NULL, 17, 0, 0, NULL),
(59, 'Pathogen Detection', 'Amplified DNA product use for the Gel Electrophoresis', 'Polymerase Chain Reaction technique allows specific region of a DNA to be amplified through the Thermal-cycler. Any kind of extracted DNA can be used as the sample and primers designed accordingly to the region to be amplified, should be provided in the reaction mixture. Amplified PCR products are used for the Electrophoresis.                                                                                  ', 'Amplifies specific region of a DNA Strand', 'TAKARA PCR Thermal Cycler, TECHNE TC-5000 PCR Thermal Cycler                 ', 0, 45, NULL, '2022-08-06 22:59:40', NULL, 18, 0, 0, NULL),
