(127, 'Electronic Instruments', '', '                                                                                    ', '', '                                                                                    ', 0, 121, NULL, '2022-09-07 09:58:52', NULL, 12, 0, 0, NULL),
(128, 'Non-Volatile Organic Compounds', 'Non-Volatile Organic Compounds', 'High performance liquid chromatography or commonly known as HPLC is an analytical technique used to separate, identify or quantify each component in a mixture. The mixture is separated using the basic principle of column chromatography and then identified and quantified by spectroscopy. ', 'Pesticides,Personal Care Products,Persistent Organic Pollutants, Pharmaceutical Chemicals, Industrial Waste etc. ', 'Thermo Fisher HPLC coupled with UV/FLD detectors ; Thermo Fisher UHPLC Tandrum quadrupole mass spectrometer ', 0, 139, NULL, '2022-09-08 15:37:04', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(129, 'Total Organic Carbon (Purified Samples EC<5μS/cm)', 'Total Organic Carbon', 'The HTY-DI1500  laboratory TOC Analyzer is designed to determinate the TOC levels of purified water and Ultra-purified water. It uses UV lamp oxidation technology for accurate, dependable operation with minimal maintenance. The analysis is made by the software installed on computer, it is easy to operate and in compliance with the GMP and 21CFR PART 11 requirements.', 'Pharmaceutical Water, Ultrapure Water, Semiconductor Water', 'Tailin-HTY-DI1500-OL', 0, 139, NULL, '2022-09-08 11:09:17', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(130, 'Carbon, Hydrogen, Nitrogen Element Analysis', 'Carbon, Hydrogen, Nitrogen', 'This elemental analyzer stands for highest performance and versatility in elemental analysis. The vario EL cube is designed for simultaneous carbon, hydrogen, nitrogen, and sulfur analysis. Vario EL cube will perfectly adjust to all your analytical needs in elemental analysis with highest precision and accuracy. Thanks to its low-maintenance design, the vario EL cube is optimized for unattended 24/7 operation and highest system uptime.', 'Soil, Sludge, Charcol, poultry feed, etc', 'Elementar - vario EL cube ', 0, 139, NULL, '2022-09-08 11:23:38', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(131, 'Volatile Organic Compounds', 'Volatile Organic Compounds', 'Gas chromatography (GC) is a common analytical technique used to separate and analyze volatile and semi-volatile compounds in a mixture. GC is a popular analytical technique as it combines exceptional resolving power with speed and sensitivity. ', 'Pesticides, Disinfection byproducts, Industrial chemicals etc. ', 'Thermo Fisher Gas Chromatograph-mass spectrometer; Thermo Fisher Gas Chrmatograph-tandem quadropole mass spectrometer;  Shimadzu Gas Chromatograph coupled with FID/ECD Detectors; Thermo Fisher Gas Chromatograph FID Detector ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-09-08 14:33:02', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(132, 'It is an optical instrument that measures the intensity of light in relation to the wavelength', 'Spectrophotometers measure absorbance (A) and transmittance (T). The intensity of light (I0) measures photons per second.', '  Widely used in various disciplines such as physics, molecular biology, chemistry and biochemistry. Applications for specs include measurement of substance concentration such as protein, DNA or RNA, growth of bacterial cells, and enzymatic reactions. Important features to look for in spectrophotometer are broad dynamic range, sample volume capability and lamp type and lifetime.                                                                             ', 'Useful to measure the absorbance, reflectance, and transmission of light by gases, liquids, and solids', '          SPECTROPHOTOMETER,JENWAY,MODEL 6305                                                                          ', 0, 12, NULL, '2022-09-08 13:35:03', NULL, 6, 0, 0, NULL),
(133, 'Based on the measurement of the emitted light intensity when a metal is introduced into the flame.', 'A Flame Photometer is a scientific instrument that is used to analyses the levels of Sodium, Lithium, Potassium, Barium or Calcium in a particular sample. Flame Photometry works by measuring the intensity of light emitted when the element is exposed to a flame.', '       The principle of flame photometer is based on the measurement of the emitted light intensity when a metal is introduced into the flame. The wavelength of the colour gives information about the element and the colour of the flame gives information about the amount of the element present in the sample.                                                                              ', 'The compounds of the alkali and alkaline earth metals (Group II) dissociate into atoms when introduced into the flame. Some of these atoms further get excited to even higher levels. But these atoms are not stable at higher levels.', '       Flame Photometer, Jenway,PFP7\r\n                                                                             ', 0, 12, NULL, '2022-09-08 14:03:23', NULL, 6, 0, 0, NULL),
(134, 'Separates the object to be heated from all byproducts of combustion from the heat source.', '-', '    Muffle furnace refers to a type of jacketed enclosure that is used to heat a material to significantly high temperatures while keeping it contained and fully isolated from external contaminants, chemicals or substances.                                                                                ', 'Allow rapid high-temperature heating, recovery, and cooling in self-contained, energy-efficient cabinet.', '             Muffle Furnace,HOBERSAL,Model  HD -230                                                                    ', 0, 12, NULL, '2022-09-08 14:24:05', NULL, 6, 0, 0, NULL),
(135, 'Inoganic Compounds ( Anions)', 'Fluoride, Chloride, Nitrate, Sulphate, Phosphate, Bromide', 'Ion chromatography, a form of liquid chromatography, measures concentrations of ionic species by separating them based on their interaction with a resin. Ionic species separate differently depending on species type and size.            ', 'Anions- Surface Water, Groundwater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'Shine- Ion Chromatograph', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-09-08 15:45:56', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(136, 'Inorganic ( Heavy Meatals)', 'Arsenic, Mercury', 'AFS is an analytical method used to determine the concentration of elements in samples. The sample is converted to gaseous atoms, and the element of interest is excited to a higher electronic energy level  by a light source.                                                              ', 'Heavy Metal- Surface Water, Groundwater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'Beifen Ruili - Atomic Fluorescence Spectroscopy  (AFS)                                          ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-09-09 10:18:33', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(137, 'Inorganic - Multi Elements', '', '                                                                                    ', '', '                                                                                    ', 1, 52, NULL, '2022-09-09 09:38:15', NULL, 20, 0, 52, '2022-09-09 09:38:38'),
(138, 'Inorganic - Multi Elements', 'Iron(Fe), Boron(B), Molybdenum(Mo), Aluminium(Al), Chromium(Cr), Copper(Cu), Zinc(Zn), Nickel(Ni), Lead(Pb), Selenium(Se), Manganese(Mn), Arsenic(As), Cadmium(Cd),  Antimony(Sb), Uranium(U)', 'Inductively coupled plasma mass spectrometry (ICP-MS) is a type of mass spectrometry that uses an inductively coupled plasma to ionize the sample. It atomizes the sample and creates atomic and small polyatomic ions, which are then detected.', 'Multi Elements- Surface Water, Groundwater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'Thermo Fisher - Inductively coupled plasma mass spectrometry                                                                             ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-09-09 10:17:44', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(139, 'Incubators are used for the growth of microorganisms in many fields.', 'Four factors are of major importance in incubating : temperature, humidity, ventilation, and turning.', '   Incubator, an insulated enclosure in which temperature, humidity, and other environmental conditions can be regulated at levels optimal for growth, hatching, or reproduction.                                                                                 ', 'To provide a controlled, contaminant-free environment for safe and reliable work with cell and tissue cultures by regulating conditions such as temperature, humidity, and CO2.', '         Incubator, Thermo Fisher Scientific\r\n         Heratherm IMH -100S                                                                  ', 0, 12, NULL, '2022-09-09 12:23:53', NULL, 6, 0, 0, NULL),
(140, 'Pharmaceutical', '', '                                                                                    ', '', '                                                                                    ', 0, 1, NULL, '2022-09-09 12:52:01', NULL, 5, 0, 0, NULL),
(141, 'Absorbance', 'Absorbance and Transmittance', 'The Ultraviolet Spectrophotometer (UV-1800) can be used to measure the absorbance and transmittance at a single or multiple wavelengths, obtain sample spectra, calculate the concentration of unknown samples through calibration curves, and analyze DNA and proteins.                                                                                  ', 'Absorbance - Surface Water, Groundwater, Drinking Water Sources, Domestic Sewage.', 'AoYo - Ultraviolet spectrometry  (UV - 1800)                                                                                ', 0, 52, NULL, '2022-09-09 14:34:42', NULL, 20, 0, 0, NULL),
(142, 'Data loggers', 'Cloud - based data delivery', 'The ZL6 data logger uses to deliver near-real-time data wherever and whenever you need it, downloading data in the field and easy to distribute and share them.                                                                                 ', 'Designed for use in researches', 'Data logger ZL6 (Maxim Integrated)                                                                    ', 0, 46, NULL, '2022-09-12 10:48:06', NULL, 7, 0, 0, NULL),
