(149, 'Herbal Pharmaceutical', 'wavelength, absorbance of particular wavelength, spectrum', ' The CAMAG TLC SCANNER 4 is designed for densitometric measurement of thin-layer chromatograms and other objects upto 200x200 mm in size. While the Scanner 4 performs the actual densitometric measurement, data is processed by the CAMAG vision CATS/win CATS Planar Chromatography Manager running on a connected computer.                                                                                   ', 'Cosmetics, Food supplementary', 'UV lamp, TLC Chambers, Orbital shaker, rotary evaporator                                                                ', 0, 83, NULL, '2022-09-12 15:05:33', NULL, 30, 0, 0, NULL),
