(167, 'Microscopy', 'Cells and cell components', '         Phase contrast microscope is a light microscope that enhances the contrast  of image of transparent and colourless specimens. It enables visualization of cells and cell components  that would be difficult to see using an ordinary light microscope                                                                         ', 'Cell culture', '                   Phase contrast microscope                                                                  ', 0, 235, NULL, '2022-09-13 11:29:15', NULL, 38, 0, 0, NULL),
