(195, 'Nitrogen Analyzer', 'Nitrogen Analysis, Protein Analysis', 'The UDK 149 is a convenient and reliable solution for safe, semi-automated distillations. The perfect distiller for laboratories looking for precise and reproducible results of Kjeldahl nitrogen TKN, proteins, ammoniacal nitrogen, nitrate nitrogen, TVBN, sulfites, phenols, volatile acids, cyanides, and alcohol content                                                                                    ', 'Food, Fertilizer', '  Scrubber                                                                                  ', 0, 211, NULL, '2022-09-13 14:21:21', NULL, 2, 0, 0, NULL),
(196, 'Nitrogen Analyzer', 'Nitrogen Analysis, Protein Analysis', 'The UDK 149 is a convenient and reliable solution for safe, semi-automated distillations. The perfect distiller for laboratories looking for precise and reproducible results of Kjeldahl nitrogen TKN, proteins, ammoniacal nitrogen, nitrate nitrogen, TVBN, sulfites, phenols, volatile acids, cyanides, and alcohol content                                                                                    ', 'Food, Fertilizer', '                                                                                    ', 0, 211, NULL, '2022-09-13 14:27:46', NULL, 2, 0, 0, NULL),
(197, 'Spectroscopy', 'phosphorus, trypsin inhibitor, tannin, phytate', '          Ultraviolet-visible (UV) visible spectrophotometer uses a light source to illuminate a sample with light across the UV to the visible wavelength range to  quantify the reaction to measure the parameters.                                                                         ', 'Absorption spectroscopy', '         Ultraviolet-visible (UV) visible spectrophotometer                                                                           ', 0, 245, NULL, '2022-09-13 14:29:50', NULL, 38, 0, 0, NULL),
(198, 'Analysis of small organic molecules', 'Analysis of Pharmaceuticals, Cosmetics, Pesticide Residues', 'The 1290 Infinity II LC System is an ultra-high-performance LC that has market-leading sample capacity and is designed for the lowest dispersion for the most challenging ultra-HPLC experiments. The 1290 Infinity II LC system is designed to be both a HPLC and high-end UHPLC system in a single flow path, giving a robust and excellent performance no matter what application is running while seamlessly integrating into existing laboratory environment                                                                                    ', 'Active pharmaceutical ingredients, Personal care products, Toxins, Pesticide residue ', '                                                                                    ', 0, 211, NULL, '2022-09-13 14:45:34', NULL, 2, 0, 0, NULL),
(199, 'Spectroscopy', 'Optical absorption or transmittance of liquids, solids and thin-films ', 'UV-Vis spectroscopy is an analytical technique that measures the amount of discrete wavelengths of UV, visible or IR light that are absorbed by or transmitted through a sample in comparison to a reference or blank sample.                                                                                     ', 'UV-Visible Spectrometer ', 'shimadzu uv-vis 1800 double-beam spectrophotometer                                                                                    ', 0, 230, NULL, '2022-09-13 15:39:18', NULL, 36, 0, 0, NULL),
(200, 'Spectroscopy', 'Functional Groups, Chemical Bonds', 'The fundamental of infrared spectroscopic technology is on atomic vibrations of a molecule that only absorbs specific frequencies and energies of infrared radiation. The molecules could be detected and classified by FTIR because different molecules will have different infrared spectrum.                                                                                    ', 'FTIR', 'IRAffinity-1S - FTIR Spectrometers                                                                                    ', 0, 230, NULL, '2022-09-13 15:41:02', NULL, 36, 0, 0, NULL),
(201, 'Thermal property measurement', 'Determine a material’s thermal stability and its fraction of volatile components by monitoring the weight change that occurs as a sample is heated at a constant rate', 'Thermogravimetric analysis, or thermal gravimetric analysis (TGA), is a method of determining the overall mass of a sample as a temperature-dependent property. Mass change as a function of temperature is a fundamental property of many materials as they degrade and lose volatile components.                                                                                    ', 'Thermogravimetric analysis', 'TGA                                                                                    ', 0, 230, NULL, '2022-09-13 15:42:05', NULL, 36, 0, 0, NULL),
(202, 'Environmental analysis', 'Concentration of Individual elements in ppm and ppb level ', 'Atomic absorption spectrometry (AAS) is used primarily to determine the concentrations of individual elements in solution. As such, AAS is used in food and beverage, water, clinical research, and pharmaceutical analysis. It is also used in mining operations to determine, metal concentration.                                                                                     ', 'Atomic Absorption Spectroscopy (AAS)', 'Atomic Absorption Spectroscopy (AAS)                                                                                    ', 0, 230, NULL, '2022-09-13 15:42:53', NULL, 36, 0, 0, NULL),
(203, 'Real Time PCR', 'Qualitative analysis of gene targets, Quantitative analysis of gene targets, Post PCR melt curve analysis.', '                                                                                    ', '', '                                                                                    ', 0, 211, NULL, '2022-09-13 16:14:16', NULL, 2, 0, 0, NULL),
