(237, '3D Printing', '', '       3D printing refers to processes used to generate a 3D object in which layers of material are successively formed under a computer controlled program to create a physical object. The 3D file source is usually sliced into several layers, each layer generating a set of computer controlled instructions.                                                                              ', 'CNC, Additive manufacturing', '                                                                                    ', 0, 322, NULL, '2022-11-29 17:30:21', NULL, 48, 0, 0, NULL),
