(242, 'Eliza Reader', 'Wavelength Range: 190 nm— 1 100', 'An Eliza reader is an instrument that is used to read the fluorescent, or chromogenic response o the Eliza in a 96-well plate. The instrument is designed to fit standard 96-well plates, and will provide quantitative information about the extent of the response for each individual well of the plate. This enables up to 96 different conditions to be examined at once.                                                                           ', 'Eliza Reader', 'Computer and\r\nAccessories\r\n96 well plate\r\n                                                            ', 0, 280, NULL, '2022-11-30 11:34:52', NULL, 36, 0, 0, NULL),
(243, 'Eliza Plate Washer', 'Washing Purpose', 'Micro plate washers are laboratory instruments designed to control the procedure of washing experimental samples arranged in plate-based formats. Users load a plate and select a program; micro plate washers then dispense, soak and aspirate liquids from the plate in seconds                                                                ', 'Eliza Plate Washer', '                                                                                    ', 0, 280, NULL, '2022-11-30 11:35:48', NULL, 36, 0, 0, NULL),
