(389, '1. Biological Fluids (Plasma/Serum)', '1. Biological Samples Blood (Plasma/Serum).Ex; Lipid Profile, Liver Profile, Serum Electrolytes.', '<p>The <strong>BA-88A Semi-Auto Chemistry Analyzer</strong> is a compact, user-friendly device designed for clinical laboratories to perform routine biochemical and clinical chemistry assays. It is widely used in small to medium-sized labs, hospitals, and diagnostic centers</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Mindray BA-88A Semi Auto Chemistry ...\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,', '', 'Name -  BA-88A\r\nModel -  Mindray Semi Automated Analyzer    \r\nSerial Number - WR-43013994                                                                      ', 1, 572, NULL, '2024-09-25 12:39:30', NULL, 4, 0, 572, '2024-09-25 12:42:36'),
