(412, 'Raman Spectroscopy (Solid, Liquid, or Powder Samples)', 'Raman shift (cm⁻¹), intensity (a.u.), laser wavelength (e.g., 514 nm, 785 nm), spectral resolution, acquisition time', '<p>High-resolution Raman spectrometer used to identify molecular structures, crystal phases, and chemical compositions through vibrational spectroscopy.&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', '    Renishaw Invia Reflex Spectrometer System (Raman Spectroscopy)                                                                            ', 0, 672, NULL, '2025-10-17 11:31:01', NULL, 29, 0, 0, NULL),
